# Loaded by `vp build` (pnpm build:web, Netlify): the hosted instance's Umami
# analytics, self-hosted and cookieless. /s.js and /api/e are proxied
# same-origin by netlify.toml's redirects (pointed at analytics.yusufaf.dev) so
# ad blockers see first-party traffic, not a cross-host request.
# See C:\Projects\umami-flyio. Unset (as in .env.selfhost), no tag is emitted.
VITE_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID=883ce165-bace-46c2-93df-994219b0f916
VITE_UMAMI_SRC=/s.js
VITE_UMAMI_HOST_URL=/
